  "hints": [
    "Scan the grid. The first time you meet a land cell that no earlier search has reached, you have found a new island.",
    "From that cell, run DFS or BFS over the 4 neighbours to visit every land cell of the same island, marking each one as visited.",
    "Mark a cell when you push it (set it to \"0\" or record it in a visited grid). Then the answer is the number of searches you started."
